 courses or programs defined on the <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/future-students/course-entry/english-proficiency-bands">English Proficiency Bands page</a>. </li></ul><p>* Further information can be found on the <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/future-students/course-entry#toggle-1">Study course entry page</a>.</p>',
