lish-proficiency-bands">English Proficiency Bands page</a>. </li></ul><p>* Further information can be found on the <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/future-students/course-entry#toggle-1">Study course entry page</a>.</p><p>This course doesn''t require an ATAR for entry.</p><p>Find out how to apply using our Creative Humanities Portfolio Entry pathway.</p><p>Admission requirements you''ll need to meet for this course.</p>',
