    course_description = '<p>With this double degree you’ll not only learn how to practise as a lawyer, including courtroom and other skills, but you’ll also develop a solid understanding of the nature of criminology, social justice and the justice system.<br/></p><p>It’s a great combination that could set you up for the future in many ways.<br/></p><p>This course has been accredited by ECU as an <a href="https://www.aqf.edu.au/framework/aqf-qualifications">AQF Level 7 Bachelor Degree<i></i></a> Award.</p><p>85 Indicative ATAR</p><p>ECU admission and English language requirements apply.</p><p>See <a href="#courseEntryDom">Course Entry</a> for further information.</p><p><a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/study/shared-content/admission-information-sets/K30.pdf">Course admission profile</a> <p><a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/study/shared-content/admission-information-sets/Whole-of-Institution-Information-Set.pdf">ECU admission profile</a></p> </p><p><a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/study/shared-content/admission-information-sets/Whole-of-Institution-Information-Set.pdf">ECU admission profile</a></p>',
