-entry/english-proficiency-bands">English Proficiency Bands page</a>. </li></ul><p>* Further information can be found on the <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/future-students/course-entry#toggle-1">Study course entry page</a>.</p><p>Applications for this course are not accepted through ECU''s Experience Based Entry Scheme.</p><p>Semester 1: Study full-time , City Campus or Online</p><p>Semester 1: Study part-time , City Campus or Online</p>',
