>. </li></ul><p>* Further information can be found on the <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/future-students/course-entry#toggle-1">Study course entry page</a>.</p><p>Semester 1: Study full-time at Joondalup, South West or Online</p><p>Semester 1: Study part-time at Joondalup, South West or Online</p><p>Semester 2: Study part-time at Joondalup, South West or Online</p><p>Students commencing this course mid-year will need to complete the course on a part-time basis, and should contact Student Hub for a personalised study schedule.</p>',
