UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>Ready to explore the transformative power of screen storytelling?<br/></p><p>This Graduate Certificate course will introduce you to a variety of production roles across screen and media industries. You’ll have a chance to apply the production skills learnt in a variety of formats including live broadcast, news, sport and entertainment, scripted and documentary work. <br/> Units completed in this course can be credited to a Graduate Diploma qualification, which in turn gives you a headstart on a Masters degree in Screen Production.<br/></p><p>This course has been accredited by ECU as an <a href="https://www.aqf.edu.au/framework/aqf-qualifications">AQF Level 8 Graduate Certificate<i></i></a> Award.</p><p>ECU admission and English language requirements apply.</p><p>See <a href="#courseEntryDom">Course Entry</a> for further information.</p><p><a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/study/shared-content/admission-information-sets/Whole-of-Institution-Information-Set.pdf">ECU admission profile</a></p><p>Domestic fee paying - estimated 1st year indicative fee <strong>AUD $11,700</strong></p><p>See <a href="#feesScholarshipsDom">Fees and Scholarships</a> for further information.</p>',
