ts/course-entry/english-proficiency-bands">English Proficiency Bands page</a>;</li> <li>Successfully completed 0.375 EFTSL of study at postgraduate level or higher at an Australian higher education provider (or equivalent);</li> <li>Where accepted, equivalent prior learning, including at least five years relevant professional experience; or</li> <li>Other tests, courses or programs defined on the <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/future-students/course-entry/english-proficiency-bands">English Proficiency Bands page</a>. </li></ul>',
