alent prior learning, including at least five years relevant professional experience; or</li> <li>Other tests, courses or programs defined on the <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/future-students/course-entry/english-proficiency-bands">English Proficiency Bands page</a>. </li></ul><p>Semester 1: Study full-time , City Campus</p><p>Semester 1: Study part-time , City Campus</p><p>Semester 2: Study full-time , City Campus</p><p>Semester 2: Study part-time at City Campus</p><p>T86|1</p><p>For more detailed unit information for this course take a look at our <a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/handbook?query=T86">Handbook</a>. To organise your life for next semester visit the <a href="https://timetable.ecu.edu.au/timetable/search">Teaching timetable</a>.</p>',
