equirements band section below.</p><p>All applicants are required to have completed a Bachelor degree in engineering or engineering technology or a Bachelor of Engineering Science, or a Master of Technology with equivalents considered, successful applicants with an Engineers Australia accredited 4 year AQF level 8 Bachelor of Engineering Honours or a Master of Technology (or equivalents) may be eligible for a reduced course duration through the award of credit and recognition of prior learning.</p>',
