UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>Thinking about a career in research?<br/></p><p>In this course you’ll do a deep dive into your chosen nursing discipline. You will develop your understanding of that discipline and learn contemporary research methods to help you undertake a significant independent research investigation, under the supervision of nursing leaders.<br/></p><p>This course has been accredited by ECU as an <a href="https://www.aqf.edu.au/framework/aqf-qualifications">AQF Level 9 Masters Degree (Research)<i></i></a> Award.</p><p>ECU admission and English language requirements apply.</p><p>See <a href="#courseEntryDom">Course Entry</a> for further information.</p><p><a href="https://www.ecu.edu.au/study/shared-content/admission-information-sets/Whole-of-Institution-Information-Set.pdf">ECU admission profile</a></p><p>The Australian Government''s Research Training Program provides tuition fee offsets for domestic students who are enrolled in Higher Degree by Research courses.</p><p>See <a href="#feesScholarshipsDom">Fees and Scholarships</a> for further information.</p>',
